;;;;;; Martini lipid topology for di-C26:0 LG (DCLG), generated using:
; The Martini lipid itp generator version M3.l01  Args are: -alname DCLG -alhead 'G P' -allink 'G L' -altail 'CCCCCC CCCCCC'
; WARNING: Autogenerated and not all lipid headgroup and tail combinations have been tested;
;          used with care and see K.B. Pedersen et al. 2024 for guidance.
;
; Description:
;   A general model plasmalogen phosphatidylglycerol (LG) lipid corresponding to atomistic C26:0 dihexacosanoyl tails.
; Parameterization:
;   This topology follows the standard Martini 3.0 lipid definitions and building block rules. 
;   Bonded parameters and mapping have been optimized as described in K.B. Pedersen et al. 2024.
; Reference(s): 
; K.B. Pedersen et al., The Martini 3 Lipidome: Expanded and Refined Parameters Improve Lipid Phase Behavior*, 
; ACS Central Science, 2025. doi: 10.1021/acscentsci.5c00755
; P.C.T. Souza et al., Martini 3: A General Purpose Force Field for Coarse-Grained Molecular Dynamics*, 
; Nature Methods, 2021. doi: 10.1038/s41592-021-01098-3
; Created: 2024.07.12
;
; Molecular topology and mapping of indices:
; GL0-PO4-GL1-C1A-C2A-C3A-C4A-C5A-C6A
;          |
;         PL2-C1B-C2B-C3B-C4B-C5B-C6B
;
;  1 - 2 - 3 - 5 - 6 - 7 - 8 - 9 - 10
;          |
;          4 - 11- 12- 13- 14- 15- 16
;
;@INSANE alhead=G P, allink=G L, altail=CCCCCC CCCCCC, alname=DCLG, charge=-1.0
;@RESNTEST DCL==DCLG if: atoms[0]==GL0
;@BEADS GL0 PO4 GL1 PL2 C1A C2A C3A C4A C5A C6A C1B C2B C3B C4B C5B C6B 
;@BONDS GL0-PO4 PO4-GL1 PO4-PL2 GL1-PL2 GL1-C1A C1A-C2A C2A-C3A C3A-C4A C4A-C5A C5A-C6A PL2-C1B C1B-C2B C2B-C3B C3B-C4B C4B-C5B C5B-C6B 
;

